-- Step 5 of 10 - The way round: a reclass journal -------------------------------------------------
  Instead of editing the payment, a reclass journal moves the amount: a debit to the right account
  and a credit to the wrong one, dated like the payment. The payment itself stays exactly as
  reconciled.
